{"id":"67ec9d5a33dd0df2","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction.md","title":"ZFC Wadge Reduction","display":"df-zfc-wadge-reduction — ZFC Wadge Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction","58-df-zfc-descriptive2-wadge-reduction","58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wadge-reduction"],"display":"df-zfc-wadge-reduction — ZFC Wadge Reduction","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-wadge-reduction</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wadge-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-wadge-reduction — ZFC Wadge Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7e537464587f340f\" href=\"?note=7e537464587f340f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,f,X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y\\in V\">\\(A,B,f,X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\)</span> is the typed continuous-map predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N=\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal N=\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal N}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal N}\\)</span> are the Baire-space carrier and topology (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e537464587f340f\" href=\"?note=7e537464587f340f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (local helper predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WadgeReduction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WadgeReduction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2WadgeReduction}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2WadgeReduction}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S(f,A,B,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq X\n\\land B\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S(f,A,B,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq X\n\\land B\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{WadgeReduction}_S(f,A,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S(f,A,B,\\mathcal N,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},\\mathcal N,\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{WadgeReduction}_S(f,A,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S(f,A,B,\\mathcal N,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},\\mathcal N,\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2WadgeReduction}_S(f,A,B,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S(f,A,B,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2WadgeReduction}_S(f,A,B,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S(f,A,B,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S(X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S(f,A,B,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S(X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcWadgeMap}_S(f,A,B,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The helper separates a reduction map from the existential reducibility relation and makes both source and target topologies explicit.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-wadge-reduction</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wadge-reduction</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7e537464587f340f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S$ is the typed continuous-map predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7e53